-- DEFERRED MUTATING NATIVE VERIFIER; NEVER RUN IN THIS SOURCE ALLOCATION.
-- Requires a separately approved direct managed synthetic target, exact owned
-- fixture receipt and current migration/profile pins. The settings below select
-- fixtures; they do NOT prove target isolation or grant permission to run this.
-- No global queue, provider, network call, source extraction or real data.
-- Operator must first create the admitted source/canonical/JD/draft through the
-- real native producers and record that fixture's owner/analysis IDs. The fixture
-- must have a first admitted whole confirmed A11 contribution of at most 500 UTF-16 units. This script
-- uses that owned value; it does not seed fabricated candidate content directly.
-- Temporary writer grants below exist ONLY in this rollback transaction. They
